0 VectorSum — two-input differential mixer and geared output dial
0 Name: vectorsum.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 !LICENSE Mixed attribution; see ../docs/SOURCE_AND_LICENSES.md.
0 // Original frame, gauge, control experiment and lessons: CrispStrobe, BSD-3-Clause.
0 // Differential core relative placements: official LDraw 65414c01.dat, Philo, CC BY 4.0.
0 // External standard LDraw meshes are referenced, not embedded.
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub; angular motors on explicit ports A and B.
0 // Saved encoder datum A=0 degrees, B=0 degrees. Reset/reload before Run.
0 // Analytical convention: sideA=-encoderA, sideB=encoderB, carrier=(sideA+sideB)/2.
0 // The yellow 12T gauge meshes with the red 28T carrier cover at a perpendicular bevel apex.
0 // Expected gauge relation about its +X axis: pointer=-(28/12)*carrier.
0 // Measure chassis at base_cross_0 local origin and output at output_pointer local point (0,20,0).
0 // Manual encoder bounds -190..190 degrees are software guidance, not physical stops.
0 // Native parser, topology, controller, physics, collisions and hardware remain UNTESTED.
